{"login": "shmileee", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "b34198f1bab8c1bdaa3530e281f92a7039fcb6ba", "message": "fix: use sudo rm for cleanup in Docker (root-owned git objects)", "created_at": "2026-04-03T14:24:11Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f695d58f5d11a27f74b05d582de86ab7afca6ed7", "message": "fix: reduce Docker build log noise to surface actual errors\n\n- Suppress ansible deprecation warnings and verbose mode in CI/Docker\n- Set HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE in Dockerfile", "created_at": "2026-04-03T14:08:27Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "84c27b5982d6d0b6d092aaea7ecc9de50d587659", "message": "fix: disable Docker build summary to stay under GitHub 1024k limit", "created_at": "2026-04-03T13:42:43Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ac0d672047b66edeaefc887beadd55eeddc3a60", "message": "fix: replace Docker Desktop with Rancher Desktop on macOS", "created_at": "2026-04-03T13:30:54Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0377155650b887a6cab2ed2a05f2731fc48f454c", "message": "fix: pin mise tool versions \u2014 'latest' breaks download URLs\n\nmaven=3.9.9, vault=1.21.4, terraform=1.14.8, python=3.14.3, yarn=4.13.0\nMise constructs download URLs with the literal string 'latest' which\ndoes not resolve to a real artifact for these providers.", "created_at": "2026-04-03T13:02:06Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ed5df1d8c32648bc2e51991272afa6ff6db0e7d", "message": "fix: use boolean conditionals for ansible list checks\n\nAnsible now requires 'when:' to evaluate to boolean, not truthy lists.\nChange 'when: var' to 'when: var | length > 0' for go and node roles.", "created_at": "2026-04-03T12:46:58Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c13c326813e403d82febddb33f8d1e98e0aee07d", "message": "fix: handle empty playbook_opts array with set -u (nounset)\n\nUse ${arr[@]+\"${arr[@]}\"} pattern to safely expand potentially empty\narrays under bash strict mode, fixing 'unbound variable' in CI", "created_at": "2026-04-03T12:33:50Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "198fbef722d18a47d2032f4592aa913d76c84493", "message": "fix: remove deprecated homebrew/bundle tap and no-quarantine option\n\n- Remove homebrew/bundle from taps (built into brew since 2024)\n- Replace install_options: no-quarantine with greedy: true (removed in community.general)\n- Add --platform=linux/amd64 to Dockerfile for arm64 compatibility\n- Copy full repo into Docker build instead of re-cloning from GitHub", "created_at": "2026-04-03T12:21:03Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1998080bc387ffc9bc25d9af490938e8e9f9fd50", "message": "fix: unblock CI and fresh macOS bootstrap\n\n- Add brew shellenv eval for macOS in install_brew.sh (was Linux-only)\n- Add ensure_brew_in_path() fallback in setup.sh, remove eval anti-pattern\n- Fix always-true sudo_required() \u2192 needs_become_pass() in ansible.sh\n- Replace removed community.general.yaml callback with ansible.builtin.default", "created_at": "2026-04-03T12:06:54Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7372ceb5ad0333678f7573d4f1a2bef195938775", "message": "chore: sync local dotfile changes\n\n- Rewrite exec-atlantis with proper ECS exec toggle, error handling, and task selection\n- Update mise tool versions (terraform, terramate, python, ruby) and add maven/yarn\n- Add copilot extras to lazyvim, disable copilot.lua, configure shfmt\n- Rename echasnovski -> nvim-mini for mini.move/surround/comment\n- Add projects-fzf fish function with Ctrl+G binding\n- Add tmux opencode waiting marker hooks and move-window binding\n- Bump nvim plugin lockfile", "created_at": "2026-04-03T11:51:41Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3dc04ee7471e2cab3680d2374bd0cf9f280ce14f", "message": "feat(vim): add `nvim-spider` and `guess-indent` plugins", "created_at": "2024-12-28T12:31:51Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f1f12be3e92ffd1c9d830856c9dc8b6694e65e66", "message": "feat(alacritty): bind cmd + 0 to reset font size", "created_at": "2024-12-28T12:31:51Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "472124d1c19001b6ddf35135c4f860c6bbe27500", "message": "feat: add vault & `t` mapping", "created_at": "2024-12-24T10:38:32Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "063e0bdff9ed3ff39100145343f761f51f394cdc", "message": "chore: add .pre-commit-config.yaml", "created_at": "2024-12-21T16:01:27Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9f43d05ed38d567a95250a51bf87a1fd50a54d36", "message": "chore(github-actions): supply `GITHUB_TOKEN` env var for macos build", "created_at": "2024-12-21T15:58:25Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "734009910a860a70cab9b203d4fea92950dfe9a2", "message": "feat(mise)!: move tools and versions from `config.yaml` to `mise/config.toml`", "created_at": "2024-12-21T13:43:44Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "34c92bf8902bdfe1827aeafb48a23160e18deaf6", "message": "feat(chezmoi): add `mise/config.toml`", "created_at": "2024-12-21T13:33:36Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4637b7f20d6c157fd4cd8571e44772e4943483cb", "me